{"data":[{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-24T06:29:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1948269217649737754"],"id":"1948269217649737754","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5073,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"意想不到，我居然被同学表白了！长这么大第一次有这样的体会，挺激动但搞对象影响学习，当色搭子还可以。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1948269217649737754"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-24T04:26:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1948238339154305082"],"id":"1948238339154305082","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4739,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"小博主是这样的，发帖没人看线下买点冰粉也做不到引流的效果，算了我还是当日记发吧，反正隔一段时间看看历史的经历和想法也挺有趣的。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1948238339154305082"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-23T10:28:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947967080239620223"],"id":"1947967080239620223","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4599,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"和我一起摆摊的同学人家的思想真超前，不管是行动力还是学习能力都比我强，要没有她我估计别说找暑假工了，已经在家葛优躺半个月了，成功的第一步是跟对有能力的人！","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947967080239620223"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-23T07:57:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947929110225031537"],"id":"1947929110225031537","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4367,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"怪不得睡前自慰完反而更清醒了，原来我过度奖励自己身体已经透支了，看样子我得管住自己的手了。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947929110225031537"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-23T04:59:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947884292849156179"],"id":"1947884292849156179","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9769,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"原来睡不着的原因是过度自慰！ https://t.co/d9Ghk0sOyy","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947884292849156179"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-23T01:34:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947832732236853609"],"id":"1947832732236853609","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5042,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有时候觉得自己的思想好龌龊，发呆的时候总幻想些那种事情，可能是因为没真实的做过所以对这件事情充满好奇，相信以后真过爱了，我就不会在这样沉迷其中了。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947832732236853609"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-22T14:21:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947663311354638595"],"id":"1947663311354638595","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4636,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我又失眠了，好焦虑但又不知道在焦虑什么，坐立难安感觉有多动症已经翻来覆去一个小时了，谁和我一样睡不着？我想自慰了，谁看！","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947663311354638595"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-22T13:25:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947649117204975658"],"id":"1947649117204975658","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":10305,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"一直害羞没敢发(*ᴗ͈ˬᴗ͈)ꕤ https://t.co/H4Sdw88HGG","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947649117204975658"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-22T08:58:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947581968612524414"],"id":"1947581968612524414","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4267,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"幻想过无数次做爱的场景，可身材和颜值都没有，终究是一场梦，不会有人愿意和我做的.....","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947581968612524414"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-22T06:00:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947537111755665807"],"id":"1947537111755665807","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":10085,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"破游戏我就不应该在下载回来，前几天打游戏被气哭了，硬是把游戏卸载了，今天手贱又下载回来了，生一肚子气！这次卸载我要在手贱下回来我就分享裸照自毁！ https://t.co/0z3tGCk4wc","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947537111755665807"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-22T02:50:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947489402764333124"],"id":"1947489402764333124","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3969,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我就说玩X的都是人上人，我问遍了我的朋友，她们都不知道什么是X，每天和我聊男生隐私可她不知道的是我都快看腻了，无非一根火腿两个鸡蛋没什么大不了的","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947489402764333124"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-21T11:51:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947263122575941751"],"id":"1947263122575941751","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5538,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"一个连一次爱都没做过的小女孩，每天却幻想着做.....","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947263122575941751"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-21T09:17:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947224303587717450"],"id":"1947224303587717450","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4683,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"哦豁！摆摊卖冰粉居然还有意外搜获?主播居然被加微信了，难以置信啊！","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947224303587717450"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-21T06:29:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947182139427942591"],"id":"1947182139427942591","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9209,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"又是假装快乐的一天 https://t.co/8cbu2yQw9r","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947182139427942591"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-21T02:10:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947116862585868588"],"id":"1947116862585868588","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4723,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近染上了醒来先自慰一次在起床，不然眼睛都睁不开困死了，刷着dy的肌肉男幻想着和他们做爱，这时候刚睡醒大脑还没清醒，虽说是幻想但爽感和真的一样，很容易就高潮了。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1947116862585868588"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-20T15:23:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946954007454593459"],"id":"1946954007454593459","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4297,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"睡不着根本睡不着😤想色色","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1946954007454593459"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-20T12:13:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946906340041105792"],"id":"1946906340041105792","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3966,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天看到一个穿短裤的帅哥，腹肌至少有八块！！明明不认识，但我就是好害羞，都不好意思直视人家，脸红ฅฅ*","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1946906340041105792"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-20T09:52:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946870706559750572"],"id":"1946870706559750572","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9191,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"又上新了，大杯只需十块！不好吃主播把摊给你 https://t.co/2jxYuHsAh3","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1946870706559750572"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-20T07:10:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946830112290156890"],"id":"1946830112290156890","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4064,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"马上要出摊了！趁着这几分钟出门前还能奖励自己一次，谁可以提供一点素材让我快速高潮？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1946830112290156890"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-20T06:24:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946818582035472809"],"id":"1946818582035472809","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":9207,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"老是睡不着觉，感觉精神出问题了，抽空来做个检查。 https://t.co/GOsdmLc8Dr","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1946818582035472809"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-19T09:15:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946499189921517979"],"id":"1946499189921517979","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9187,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"都说了嫌我玩的菜的不要来！我本身就菜之前又不是没说过，看看我之前发作品每天说菜菜菜，还要和我玩其他三个队友都没说啥，居然被一起玩的给骂了，玩个游戏输赢又怎样，卸载了。勿念 https://t.co/zE7ZjpvVTr","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1946499189921517979"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-19T02:36:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946398607529398730"],"id":"1946398607529398730","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4132,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我不穿内裤了，天气太热了，下午摆摊出去早了街上人少天气还热，出去晚了被挤兑的没地方摆摊了，热的浑身全是汗，好想干脆不穿内裤体验风吹裤裆的感觉～","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1946398607529398730"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-18T14:35:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946217207572382140"],"id":"1946217207572382140","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":9489,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"为了不影响第二天出摊，我特意买了褪黑素，以后睡前不用自慰也能安心入眠啦～ https://t.co/gWN71xpSLb","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1946217207572382140"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-18T10:45:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946159301107892329"],"id":"1946159301107892329","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4077,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我就是个臭卖冰粉的，偶尔涩涩一下，没有那么漂亮，不值得被你们包养，不要在私信我了！涩涩欢迎，但我不需要任何人包养。在说一次！不线下不线下！","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1946159301107892329"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-07-18T08:01:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946118056213631288"],"id":"194611805621363128